  "form_style": "regular",
  "help": "<p><strong>What it does</strong></p>\n<p>Given a fitted estimator and new data sets, this tool outpus the prediction results on the data sets via invoking the estimator's <cite>predict</cite> or <cite>predict_proba</cite> method.</p>\n<p>For estimator, this tool supports fitted sklearn estimators and trained deep learning models. It predicts on three different dataset inputs,</p>\n<ul class=\"simple\">\n<li>tabular</li>\n<li>sparse</li>\n<li>bio-sequences in a fasta file</li>\n<li>reference genome and variant call file</li>\n</ul>\n",
